.TH CLEARVEIL 1 "August 2026" "Clearveil 0.2.0-beta.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
clearveil \- fast, friendly image viewer for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B clearveil
[\fIOPTION\fR] [\fIIMAGE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clearveil (Chinese display name: 云开见月明) is a single-instance image viewer with folder browsing,
thumbnail navigation, animation and multi-page support, lightweight editing,
metadata inspection, comparison, slideshow, and file management.
.PP
Opening more images while Clearveil is already running sends them to the
existing application process.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command-line help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show the application version.
.SH SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Open images.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Shift+O
Open a folder.
.TP
.B Left, Right
Show the previous or next image.
.TP
.B 0, 1
Fit to window or show at actual size.
.TP
.B B, T
Toggle folder browser or thumbnail strip.
.TP
.B F11
Toggle full screen.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/Clearveil/clearveil.conf
Per-user preferences.
